    <visualElement>
      <elementName>Text</elementName>
      <elementAttributes>
        <entry>
          <string>Description</string>
          <string>P01 ALU adder/subtractor - Digital task
8-bit version. Build a full adder from gates first, then chain eight of them; XOR gates on b make the subtractor.
Allowed parts: And, Or, Not, NAnd, NOr, XOr, XNOr + wiring parts
Do not rename, move or delete the input and output pins.</string>
        </entry>
      </elementAttributes>
      <pos x="100" y="40"/>
